    "id": "intercept-tracking-curve-aim-point-of-crossing-target",
    "title": "The reaction-time tracking curve: the aim point of a constant-velocity target stays at its tick-0 position until the second sample, then leads it",
    "oolite": [
      "src/Core/Entities/ShipEntity.m:5412-5489",
      "src/Core/Entities/ShipEntity.m:2131-2131",
